        "id": "tb-context",
        "moduleId": "context-and-contrast",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材中的定位",
        "markdown": "教材在讨论预测模型的效度与 social network analysis 之后，把 personalisation of learning 列为 learning analytics 的另一类用途。它与识别谁需要帮助的预测分析不同，关注的是接下来学什么、沿着哪条路径学。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-6b22d7784a983e92d3f54d80",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000035"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "4. Findings and impact – lessons from the case studies",
                "Personalisation of learning"
              ],
              "lineStart": 211,
              "lineEnd": 217,
              "assetRefs": [],
