            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-contrast",
        "moduleId": "context-and-contrast",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "预测与个性化的关注点差异",
        "markdown": "可以用一个问题区分两者：预测分析回答这位学习者是否可能遇到风险，个性化回答基于当前情况下一步应提供哪些学习活动、进度反馈或模块选择。前者通常输出风险标记，后者输出面向学习过程的建议与路径选项。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-context"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-definition",
        "moduleId": "concept-and-mechanism",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "个性化学习的教材表述",
        "markdown": "教材把 personalisation of learning 描述为：引导学习者沿着符合其具体需求的学习路径前进。这里的个性化不只是推荐内容，还包括根据学习者当前情况调整其所处的学习位置与可选模块。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-6b22d7784a983e92d3f54d80",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000035"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "4. Findings and impact – lessons from the case studies",
                "Personalisation of learning"
              ],
              "lineStart": 211,
              "lineEnd": 217,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "12f63c42228049bbfa5ec1ff1e4e815d9a9f0c685e05abe187dffd84016bf471"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-mechanism",
        "moduleId": "concept-and-mechanism",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "三类分析输出",
        "markdown": "教材指出，个性化学习中数据被用于三件事：生成学习活动建议、指示朝向学习成果的进展，以及依据学习者当前情况将其引导到替代模块。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-6b22d7784a983e92d3f54d80",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000035"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "4. Findings and impact – lessons from the case studies",
                "Personalisation of learning"
              ],
              "lineStart": 211,
              "lineEnd": 217,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "12f63c42228049bbfa5ec1ff1e4e815d9a9f0c685e05abe187dffd84016bf471"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-loop",
        "moduleId": "concept-and-mechanism",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "个性化反馈闭环（模型整理）",
        "markdown": "把教材的三类输出串起来，可以得到一个反馈闭环：采集学习者的当前数据，更新对其需求与进展的判断，生成活动建议、进度提示或模块路由，学习者采纳、调整或拒绝，并产生新的学习数据。个性化因此不是一次性的分班，而是随学习过程持续修正的路径支持。\n\n需要强调：教材描述的是 analytics 提供建议与路由，最终选择仍涉及学习者的具体情况，不能把闭环理解成系统单方面决定学习者的路径。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-definition",
            "tb-mechanism"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-profiles",
        "moduleId": "data-and-profiles",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "PASS 的数据组合",
        "markdown": "教材以 Open Universities Australia 的 PASS 为例：它把来自 student profile、learning profile 与 curriculum profile 的统计数据和定性数据结合起来，同时使用讨论论坛数据与对开放式问题的回答，用来为每位学习者个性化学习体验。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-6b22d7784a983e92d3f54d80",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000035"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "4. Findings and impact – lessons from the case studies",
                "Personalisation of learning"
              ],
              "lineStart": 211,
              "lineEnd": 217,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "12f63c42228049bbfa5ec1ff1e4e815d9a9f0c685e05abe187dffd84016bf471"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-profile-why",
        "moduleId": "data-and-profiles",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "为什么统计与定性数据要结合",
        "markdown": "统计类数据适合描述发生了多少、变化趋势如何，例如参与度或进展；定性数据更适合解释为什么这样发生，例如学习者的目标、困难与对开放问题的自述。三类画像加上论坛与开放回答，使建议既能反映行为模式，也能照顾具体情境。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-profiles"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-pass",
        "moduleId": "case-pass",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "application",
        "title": "PASS 的个性化目标",
        "markdown": "PASS at OUA 的目标是为每位学习者个性化学习体验，尤其是课程学习所经过的路径（the path through the curriculum）。这与教材对个性化学习的总体描述一致：用数据帮助学习者找到更贴合自身情况的课程路径。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
